{
 "GPD: Distilling Routed 3D Privilege · REAL Lab Blog": "GPD: Distilling Routed 3D Privilege · REAL Lab 博客",
 "GPD trains an RGB-only vision-language model with a teacher that sees question-routed depth, semantic and bird's-eye-view cues. Qwen3-VL-4B: 57.1 on VSI-Bench and 37.6 on four further spatial benchmarks, ahead of GRPO and answer-privileged OPSD.": "GPD 训练仅以 RGB 为输入的视觉语言模型，训练中的教师可获得按问题路由的深度、语义和鸟瞰图线索。以 Qwen3-VL-4B 为基座，GPD 在 VSI-Bench 上取得 57.1，在另外四个空间推理基准上平均取得 37.6，均高于 GRPO 和以答案为特权信息的 OPSD。",
 "Use the scene's true geometry as a teacher's privilege during training, and deploy an RGB-only model that has absorbed it.": "训练阶段以场景的真实几何作为教师的特权信息，部署阶段使用已吸收该信息、仅以 RGB 为输入的模型。",
 "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">Blog</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>October 20, 2026</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Spatial intelligence · Reinforcement learning</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>10 min read</span>": "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">博客</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>2026 年 10 月 20 日</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>空间智能 · 强化学习</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>阅读约 10 分钟</span>",
 "Vision-language models misjudge depth and direction because RGB frames carry no geometry. GPD hands the scene's true geometry to a teacher during training, only the parts each question needs, and deploys a model that still sees RGB alone.": "RGB 图像不包含几何信息，视觉语言模型因而常在深度和方向上判断失误。GPD 在训练中将场景的真实几何提供给教师，且仅提供每个问题所需的部分；部署的模型仍只以 RGB 为输入。",
 "<sup>1</sup>Zhejiang University · *Equal contribution †Corresponding author": "<sup>1</sup>浙江大学 · *同等贡献 †通讯作者",
 "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12355\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Paper</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/GPD\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>Code</a>": "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12355\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>论文</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/GPD\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>代码</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>Errors start in perception</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>错误源于感知</a>",
 "<a href=\"#method\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>How GPD works</a>": "<a href=\"#method\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>GPD 方法</a>",
 "<a href=\"#privilege\">3D cues as text, routed</a>": "<a href=\"#privilege\">3D 线索的文本化与路由</a>",
 "<a href=\"#distill\">A teacher that corrects mistakes</a>": "<a href=\"#distill\">教师纠错</a>",
 "<a href=\"#results\"><span class=\"n\">3</span>Results</a>": "<a href=\"#results\"><span class=\"n\">3</span>实验结果</a>",
 "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>What matters</a>": "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>关键因素</a>",
 "<a href=\"#internal\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>Is the geometry absorbed?</a>": "<a href=\"#internal\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>模型是否吸收了几何信息</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\">Errors start in perception</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\">错误源于感知</a>",
 "<a href=\"#method\">How GPD works</a>": "<a href=\"#method\">GPD 方法</a>",
 "<a href=\"#results\">Results</a>": "<a href=\"#results\">实验结果</a>",
 "<a href=\"#ablations\">What matters</a>": "<a href=\"#ablations\">关键因素</a>",
 "<a href=\"#internal\">Is the geometry absorbed?</a>": "<a href=\"#internal\">模型是否吸收了几何信息</a>",
 "Ask a vision-language model how far the sofa is from the door, or whether the microwave is left or right of the chair, and it often gets the geometry wrong, then reasons fluently from the wrong facts. Training with outcome rewards only tells it the final answer was wrong. Adding 3D encoders or tools fixes the input, but costs architecture changes and inference time.": "询问视觉语言模型沙发与门相距多远，或微波炉位于椅子左侧还是右侧，模型常常判断错几何关系，随后在错误事实的基础上作出看似流畅的推理。仅使用结果奖励训练，只能告知模型最终答案错误。引入 3D 编码器或外部工具可以修正输入，但需要修改模型结构，并增加推理时间。",
 "GPD (Geometry-Privileged Distillation) uses geometry where it is cheap: in training. Spatial datasets built from 3D scans already contain depth, object semantics and room layout. GPD turns them into short text, keeps only the cues each question needs, and gives them, with the reference answer, to a teacher that is the same model. While GRPO trains on the outcome, the teacher corrects the student's incorrect rollouts token by token. <strong>At deployment the model sees RGB frames and the question, nothing else.</strong>": "GPD（Geometry-Privileged Distillation，几何特权蒸馏）在成本较低的训练阶段使用几何信息。基于 3D 扫描构建的空间数据集本身已包含深度、物体语义和房间布局。GPD 将其转写为简短文本，只保留每个问题所需的线索，并连同参考答案提供给教师，教师与学生为同一模型。GRPO 依据结果奖励训练的同时，教师逐 token 修正学生答错的 rollout。<strong>部署时，模型的输入仅为 RGB 帧和问题。</strong>",
 "<strong>On Qwen3-VL-4B, GPD reaches 57.1 on VSI-Bench and 37.6 on average over MindCube, SPAR-Bench, MMSI-Bench and ViewSpatial, ahead of both GRPO (56.4 and 35.7) and self-distillation with the answer as the only privilege (55.7 and 31.5).</strong>": "<strong>以 Qwen3-VL-4B 为基座，GPD 在 VSI-Bench 上取得 57.1，在 MindCube、SPAR-Bench、MMSI-Bench 和 ViewSpatial 上平均取得 37.6，均高于 GRPO（56.4 和 35.7）以及仅以答案为特权信息的自蒸馏（55.7 和 31.5）。</strong>",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">VSI-Bench, Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">Best of the controlled variants</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">MindCube, SPAR, MMSI, ViewSpatial: average</p><p class=\"card-t\">+1.9 over GRPO, +6.1 over OPSD</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#privilege\"><p class=\"card-k\">Zero-shot, VSI subset, Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">Only routed text helps</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#internal\"><p class=\"card-k\">Gain from adding 3D text at test time</p><p class=\"card-t\">GPD needs it less</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">VSI-Bench，Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">同条件对比中最优</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">MindCube、SPAR、MMSI、ViewSpatial 平均</p><p class=\"card-t\">较 GRPO 高 1.9，较 OPSD 高 6.1</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#privilege\"><p class=\"card-k\">零样本，VSI 子集，Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">仅路由后的文本有效</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#internal\"><p class=\"card-k\">测试时加入 3D 文本带来的增益</p><p class=\"card-t\">GPD 对其依赖更低</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>Spatial errors start in perception": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>空间推理错误源于感知",
 "Spatial reasoning asks a model to judge distance, direction and layout: plan a route, grasp the nearest object, estimate the size of a room. Two lines of work address it. <strong>Explicit 3D methods</strong> add geometric encoders or call reconstruction and perception tools at test time; they gain geometric evidence but change the architecture and slow inference. <strong>Training-based methods</strong> keep inference RGB-only and fine-tune or reinforce on spatial question answering, but their supervision is the final answer, so a wrong depth order or a flipped left–right relation along the way is never located, let alone corrected.": "空间推理要求模型判断距离、方向和布局，例如规划路线、抓取最近的物体、估计房间大小。现有工作主要分为两类。<strong>显式 3D 方法</strong>引入几何编码器，或在测试时调用重建与感知工具，由此获得几何证据，但需要修改模型结构，推理速度也随之下降。<strong>基于训练的方法</strong>在推理时只使用 RGB，在空间问答数据上微调或以强化学习训练模型，但其监督信号仅为最终答案，推理过程中深度顺序的错误或左右关系的颠倒既无法定位，更无从纠正。",
 "On-policy self-distillation (OPSD) offers token-level supervision: the same model, given privileged context, re-scores the student's own trajectory. Its usual privilege is the reference answer. That cannot fix a spatial error, because the error is perceptual: <strong>a misjudged depth or direction can be corrected only by the scene's true geometry.</strong> And different questions rest on different evidence: counting on semantics, distance on depth, layout on a top-down view.": "On-policy 自蒸馏（OPSD）提供 token 级监督：同一模型在获得特权上下文后，对学生自身的轨迹重新评分。其特权信息通常为参考答案，但空间错误源于感知，参考答案无法纠正此类错误：<strong>深度或方向的误判只能依靠场景的真实几何纠正。</strong>同时，不同问题依赖的证据各不相同：计数依赖语义，距离依赖深度，布局依赖俯视图。",
 "<span class=\"n\">2</span>How GPD works": "<span class=\"n\">2</span>GPD 方法",
 "GPD has two stages. Offline, it builds question-relevant 3D cues for every training example. During training, one VLM plays two roles under two contexts. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> walks through both.": "GPD 分为两个阶段。离线阶段为每条训练样本构建与问题相关的 3D 线索；训练阶段由同一个 VLM 在两种上下文下分别担任学生和教师。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 展示了这两个阶段。",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">1</span>Route 3D cues<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">1</span>路由 3D 线索<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">2</span>Student<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">2</span>学生<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">3</span>Teacher<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">3</span>教师<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">4</span>Update<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">4</span>更新<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<b>Route 3D cues</b><span>offline, per question</span>": "<b>路由 3D 线索</b><span>离线完成，逐题路由</span>",
 "<b>Student</b><span>RGB frames + question only</span>": "<b>学生</b><span>仅输入 RGB 帧和问题</span>",
 "“Near the bed, looking at the chair: is the microwave on the chair’s left or right?”": "“位于床边、面向椅子时，微波炉在椅子的左侧还是右侧？”",
 "GRPO scores every rollout by its answer. Rollouts with reward <span class=\"mi\">R</span> &lt; 0.5 go to the teacher.": "GRPO 依据答案为每个 rollout 评分，奖励 <span class=\"mi\">R</span> &lt; 0.5 的 rollout 交由教师处理。",
 "<b>Teacher</b><span>same weights + routed 3D cues + answer</span>": "<b>教师</b><span>相同权重 + 路由 3D 线索 + 答案</span>",
 "<span>student: <b>A. Right</b></span><span>reference: <b>B. Left</b></span>": "<span>学生：<b>A. 右侧</b></span><span>参考答案：<b>B. 左侧</b></span>",
 "<span><i class=\"hi\"></i>teacher agrees</span><span><i class=\"lo\"></i>teacher disagrees</span>": "<span><i class=\"hi\"></i>教师认可</span><span><i class=\"lo\"></i>教师不认可</span>",
 "<b>Update, then deploy</b><span>one set of weights</span>": "<b>更新后部署</b><span>仅一套权重</span>",
 "<span class=\"mi\">L</span> = <span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>GRPO</sub> + <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> · min(<span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>OPSD</sub> on incorrect rollouts, 1.5), <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> = 0.003": "<span class=\"mi\">L</span> = <span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>GRPO</sub> + <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> · min(<span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>OPSD</sub>（仅计答错的 rollout）, 1.5), <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> = 0.003",
 "<span class=\"m4-in\">RGB frames</span><span class=\"m4-in\">question</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-model\">GPD model</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-in ok\">answer</span>": "<span class=\"m4-in\">RGB 帧</span><span class=\"m4-in\">问题</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-model\">GPD 模型</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-in ok\">答案</span>",
 "No depth, segmentation or layout at test time: the geometry lives in the weights.": "测试时无需深度、分割或布局信息，几何知识已存储于权重之中。",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> GPD in four steps. <b>Route:</b> the base VLM chooses which cues each question needs, following the paper's routing analysis (counting uses semantics; absolute distance uses depth; room size uses the top-down view; relative direction uses semantics and the top-down view); the privilege block is the paper's example. <b>Student:</b> the model samples a group of answers from RGB alone (rewards here are illustrative). <b>Teacher:</b> the same model, given the routed cues and the answer, re-scores an incorrect rollout token by token; the example and its shading follow the paper's Figure 3. <b>Update:</b> GRPO plus the gated distillation loss; the deployed model is RGB-only.": "<b>图 1：</b>GPD 的四个步骤。<b>路由：</b>基座 VLM 为每个问题选择所需线索，路由结果依据论文的路由分析（计数使用语义，绝对距离使用深度，房间面积使用俯视图，相对方向使用语义和俯视图）；特权信息块为论文中的示例。<b>学生：</b>模型仅依据 RGB 采样一组答案，图中奖励仅作示意。<b>教师：</b>同一模型在获得路由线索和答案后，逐 token 对一条答错的 rollout 重新评分；示例及其着色依据论文图 3。<b>更新：</b>GRPO 损失加上带门控的蒸馏损失；部署的模型仅以 RGB 为输入。",
 "3D cues as text, routed per question": "按问题路由的文本化 3D 线索",
 "For every training example, GPD builds up to three cues once, offline. Where a dataset comes from 3D scans, as VSI and SPAR do from ScanNet, the cues come straight from the annotations; otherwise depth is estimated with Depth Anything 3 and objects with Grounded-SAM-2. A fixed template turns each cue into a few lines of text: <strong>depth</strong> lists objects from near to far with distances, <strong>semantics</strong> lists objects with their image regions, and the <strong>bird’s-eye view</strong> gives top-down positions relative to the camera.": "GPD 为每条训练样本离线构建至多三种线索，仅需构建一次。VSI 和 SPAR 等源自 ScanNet 3D 扫描的数据集，线索直接取自标注；其他数据集则使用 Depth Anything 3 估计深度，使用 Grounded-SAM-2 检测物体。每种线索均按固定模板转写为数行文本：<strong>深度</strong>线索按由近及远的顺序列出物体及其距离，<strong>语义</strong>线索列出物体及其所在图像区域，<strong>鸟瞰图</strong>线索给出物体相对于相机的俯视位置。",
 "Not every question needs every cue, and injecting all of them dilutes the teacher's signal. The base VLM therefore picks the relevant subset for each question, offline. The routes it picks are intuitive: counting goes entirely to semantics, absolute distance mostly to depth, room size mostly to the top-down view, and relative direction to semantics plus the top-down view.": "并非每个问题都需要全部线索，全部注入反而会稀释教师信号。因此，GPD 由基座 VLM 离线为每个问题选择相关的线索子集。路由结果符合直觉：计数问题全部路由至语义，绝对距离主要路由至深度，房间面积主要路由至俯视图，相对方向路由至语义和俯视图。",
 "Text turns out to be the right form for this privilege. In a zero-shot test before any training, given to Qwen3-VL-4B without the answer, <strong>routed text is the only form of 3D input that beats RGB alone</strong> (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">Figure 2</a>).": "文本是承载此类特权信息的合适形式。在训练前的零样本测试中，向 Qwen3-VL-4B 提供不含答案的 3D 输入，<strong>路由后的文本是唯一优于仅用 RGB 的 3D 输入形式</strong>，如<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">图 2</a>所示。",
 "Qwen3-VL-4B, zero-shot, 1,000 VSI-590K questions, no reference answer": "Qwen3-VL-4B，零样本，VSI-590K 中的 1,000 个问题，不提供参考答案",
 "Accuracy with different forms of 3D input (%)": "不同形式 3D 输入下的准确率（%）",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> The same RGB frames plus 3D cues given as rendered images or as text, either all cues or only the routed ones (paper Figure 5, left). The dashed line is RGB only; the axis starts at 40.": "<b>图 2：</b>在相同 RGB 帧的基础上加入 3D 线索，线索以渲染图像或文本形式给出，并分为全部线索与仅路由线索两种设置，数据来自论文图 5 左。虚线表示仅使用 RGB 的结果；坐标轴从 40 开始。",
 "A teacher that corrects mistakes": "教师纠错",
 "During training, the student sees <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span> = (RGB, question) and samples a group of eight answers; GRPO turns their rewards into advantages. The teacher is the same network given <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span> = (RGB, question, routed cues, answer). For each token <span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> the student sampled, GPD compares the two log-probabilities, Δ = log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span>) − log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span>), and uses <span class=\"mi\">e</span><sup>Δ</sup> − Δ − 1 as a cheap estimate of the reverse KL.": "训练时，学生的输入为 <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span> = (RGB, 问题)，每个问题采样 8 个答案，GRPO 将其奖励转化为优势。教师为同一网络，输入为 <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span> = (RGB, 问题, 路由线索, 答案)。对学生采样的每个 token <span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span>，GPD 比较两种输入下的对数概率 Δ = log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span>) − log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span>)，并以 <span class=\"mi\">e</span><sup>Δ</sup> − Δ − 1 作为反向 KL 的低成本估计。",
 "Two choices keep this signal clean. <strong>It applies only to incorrect rollouts</strong> (reward below 0.5): on correct ones the teacher can only add noise. And the averaged loss is <strong>clipped at 1.5</strong>, then added to GRPO with weight λ = 0.003. The teacher thereby shapes the student's own reasoning, along its own trajectory, rather than asking it to imitate text the teacher wrote.": "两项设计用于保持该信号的纯净。一是<strong>仅作用于答错的 rollout</strong>，即奖励低于 0.5 的 rollout；对于答对的 rollout，教师只会引入噪声。二是将平均损失<strong>截断于 1.5</strong>，再以权重 λ = 0.003 加入 GRPO 损失。由此，教师沿学生自身的轨迹塑造其推理，而非要求学生模仿教师生成的文本。",
 "<span class=\"n\">3</span>Results": "<span class=\"n\">3</span>实验结果",
 "We train Qwen3-VL-Instruct at 2B and 4B for one epoch on 10K VSI, 4K SPAR and 1K MindCube questions, and compare with GRPO and with OPSD that uses the reference answer as its only privilege, all on the same data, backbone and settings.": "实验以 10K 条 VSI、4K 条 SPAR 和 1K 条 MindCube 问题训练 2B 和 4B 规模的 Qwen3-VL-Instruct，训练 1 个 epoch，并与 GRPO 及仅以参考答案为特权信息的 OPSD 比较；各方法使用相同的数据、骨干模型和训练设置。",
 "Controlled comparison, same data and backbone": "相同数据与骨干模型下的对照实验",
 "VSI-Bench, average accuracy": "VSI-Bench，平均准确率",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> Base model, GRPO, answer-privileged OPSD and GPD on five spatial benchmarks (paper Tables 1 and 2). “Average of four” is the mean over MindCube, SPAR, MMSI and ViewSpatial. GPD has the best average on both scales, though not on every benchmark: OPSD leads on ViewSpatial at 4B, and GRPO on SPAR at 2B.": "<b>图 3：</b>基座模型、GRPO、以答案为特权信息的 OPSD 与 GPD 在五个空间推理基准上的结果，数据来自论文表 1 和表 2。“四项平均”为 MindCube、SPAR、MMSI 和 ViewSpatial 的平均值。GPD 在两种规模下的平均分均为最高，但并非在每个基准上都最优：4B 规模下 OPSD 在 ViewSpatial 上领先，2B 规模下 GRPO 在 SPAR 上领先。",
 "<strong>On VSI-Bench</strong>, GPD-4B reaches 57.1, 1.7 points above the base model, 0.7 above GRPO and 1.4 above OPSD, with its gains on geometry-heavy subtasks such as relative distance and direction. <strong>On the four other benchmarks</strong> it averages 37.6, 1.9 points above GRPO and 6.1 above OPSD, with the largest gain on MindCube (38.0 against 33.0 for GRPO). The 2B model shows the same ordering on both averages (51.7 and 33.6). Answer-only OPSD often falls below GRPO, a reminder that an answer alone does not say where the reasoning went wrong.": "<strong>在 VSI-Bench 上</strong>，GPD-4B 取得 57.1，比基座模型高 1.7 分，比 GRPO 高 0.7 分，比 OPSD 高 1.4 分，提升集中于相对距离、相对方向等依赖几何的子任务。<strong>在另外四个基准上</strong>，其平均分为 37.6，比 GRPO 高 1.9 分，比 OPSD 高 6.1 分，其中 MindCube 上提升最大，GPD 为 38.0，GRPO 为 33.0。2B 模型在两项平均分上呈现相同的排序，GPD 分别为 51.7 和 33.6。仅以答案为特权信息的 OPSD 常低于 GRPO，说明仅凭答案无法指出推理在何处出错。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>What matters": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>关键因素",
 "We ablate on Qwen3-VL-4B, averaging over all five benchmarks. <strong>The answer and the geometry are complementary:</strong> adding the reference answer alone gives 40.2, routed 3D text alone 40.5, and both together 41.5, against 39.8 for GRPO. <strong>Routing beats more context:</strong> injecting all 3D text, with the answer, falls to 39.8, the same as GRPO, and routed cues rendered as images reach 40.4. <strong>The weight matters, and so does the gate:</strong> λ = 0.003 is best, and applying the teacher to every rollout instead of only incorrect ones costs 0.9 points.": "消融实验基于 Qwen3-VL-4B，指标为五个基准的平均分，GRPO 为 39.8。<strong>答案与几何信息互补：</strong>仅加入参考答案为 40.2，仅加入路由 3D 文本为 40.5，二者同时加入为 41.5。<strong>路由优于增加上下文：</strong>注入全部 3D 文本及答案时降至 39.8，与 GRPO 相同；将路由线索渲染为图像时为 40.4。<strong>权重与门控均有影响：</strong>λ = 0.003 时效果最佳；若教师作用于全部 rollout 而非仅作用于答错的 rollout，平均分下降 0.9。",
 "Qwen3-VL-4B, average of five benchmarks": "Qwen3-VL-4B，五个基准平均分",
 "Which privilege, in which form": "特权信息的内容与形式",
 "Same setting": "相同实验设置",
 "Distillation weight λ and scope": "蒸馏权重 λ 与作用范围",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> <b>Left:</b> privilege ablation (paper Figure 4, left). Base and OPSD are averaged from the per-benchmark tables. <b>Right:</b> the distillation weight with incorrect-only gating, against GRPO (dashed) and the all-rollouts variant at λ = 0.003 (paper Figure 4, right; values reported in the text).": "<b>图 4：</b><b>左：</b>特权信息消融，数据来自论文图 4 左；基座模型和 OPSD 的数值由各基准表格求平均得到。<b>右：</b>仅在答错的 rollout 上蒸馏时不同蒸馏权重的结果，虚线为 GRPO，另列出 λ = 0.003 时作用于全部 rollout 的变体；数据来自论文图 4 右，数值取自正文。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>Is the geometry absorbed?": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>模型是否吸收了几何信息",
 "If GPD internalizes the cues, giving them back at test time should help it less. That is what happens (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">Figure 5</a>): with RGB alone, GPD scores 56.3 against 54.9 for GRPO; adding routed 3D text at test time lifts GRPO by 2.1 points but GPD by only 0.6.": "若 GPD 已内化这些线索，测试时再提供线索带来的收益应当更小。实验结果与此一致，如<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">图 5</a>所示：仅使用 RGB 时，GPD 为 56.3，GRPO 为 54.9；测试时加入路由 3D 文本后，GRPO 提升 2.1 分，GPD 仅提升 0.6 分。",
 "Accuracy with RGB only, and with routed 3D text added at test time": "仅使用 RGB 与测试时加入路由 3D 文本的准确率",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> Test-time dependence on 3D privilege (paper Figure 7; the axis starts at 50). The smaller gap for GPD suggests the geometric cues were absorbed during training.": "<b>图 5：</b>测试时对 3D 特权信息的依赖程度，数据来自论文图 7，坐标轴从 50 开始。GPD 的差距更小，表明其在训练中已吸收几何线索。",
 "The training curves agree. Validation accuracy is similar early on, then GPD keeps improving while GRPO plateaus; GPD's policy entropy peaks higher and earlier, a sign that the teacher's signal broadens exploration before the two settle. In the paper's case study, a four-view question about walking toward a stone fountain, GPD localizes the camera, maps the turn into the scene's frame and finds the fountain across views, while GRPO places the fountain on the wrong side of a jar and answers wrongly.": "训练曲线支持同一结论。训练初期两者的验证准确率相近，此后 GRPO 趋于平稳，GPD 则持续提升；GPD 的策略熵峰值更高、出现更早，表明在两者收敛之前，教师信号扩大了探索范围。论文的案例分析中有一道四视角问题，涉及朝一座石制喷泉行走的情形：GPD 先定位相机，将转向映射到场景坐标系，并跨视角找到喷泉；GRPO 则将喷泉置于罐子的错误一侧，最终答错。",
 "Animated drawing: an ink path leaves a torn paper cube, bends at a node and reaches a flat sheet, on which a faint outline of the cube appears": "动画：一条墨迹路径从撕开的纸质立方体出发，在节点处转折，抵达一张平整的纸面，纸面上浮现出立方体的淡淡轮廓",
 "Backbone": "骨干模型",
 "Benchmark": "评测基准"
}